Be clear about what this pack contains: the images are **frames from the
Naruto Shippuden anime**, cropped and re-encoded for this app. They were
collected from the fan project at
https://github.com/LOSXinfinity/Naruto-25th-Anniversary- , which publishes them
without a licence of its own. Nothing in that chain grants anybody the right to
redistribute them — not that project, and not this one.

Therefore:

  • This pack is NOT MIT and NOT CC0, whatever the root LICENSE says.
  • It is provided for personal, non-commercial use only.
  • You may not sell it, bundle it in a paid product, or relicense it.
  • If a rights holder objects, this folder will be deleted. The app keeps
    working — the mascot system is pluggable and the CC0 "ember" pack ships
    alongside it.

See docs/LEGAL.md for the full policy, and for how to request a takedown.
